<title>USA: EA Industries President Spalliero resigns.</title>
<headline>EA Industries President Spalliero resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WEST LONG BRANCH, N.J. 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>EA Industries Inc said on Monday its president and director, Joseph Spalliero, resigned.</p>
<p>Chairman Irwin Gross would assume the title of president, it said.</p>
</text>
